{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "```python\ndef _calculate_digit_sum(substring: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of digit characters within a substring.\n    Non-digit characters are ignored in the sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    digit_sum = 0\n    for char in substring:\n        if '0' <= char <= '9':  # Check if character is a digit\n            digit_sum += int(char)\n    return digit_sum\n\ndef count_Substrings(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of their digit characters equals their length.\n    This function processes all possible substrings of the input string.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_count = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    for start_index in range(n):\n        for end_index in range(start_index, n):\n            substring = input_string[start_index : end_index + 1]\n            substring_length = len(substring)\n            digit_sum = _calculate_digit_sum(substring)\n\n            if digit_sum == substring_length:\n                total_count += 1\n    return total_count\n```"}
