{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "```python\ndef comb_sort(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of comparable elements in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\n    Returns a new sorted list without modifying the original input list.\"\"\"\n\n    new_list = list(input_list)\n    n = len(new_list)\n    gap = n\n    swaps_made = True\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n\n    while gap > 1 or swaps_made:\n        # Calculate the new gap value.\n        gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n\n        swaps_made = False\n        # Perform a single pass of \"Bubble Sort\" with the current gap.\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if new_list[i] > new_list[i + gap]:\n                new_list[i], new_list[i + gap] = new_list[i + gap], new_list[i]\n                swaps_made = True\n\n    return new_list\n```"}
