{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "```python\ndef is_Diff(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if an integer is divisible by 11 using the alternating sum of digits method.\n    It returns True if divisible, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_abs = abs(number)\n    num_str = str(num_abs)\n\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    sign = 1\n\n    for i in range(len(num_str) - 1, -1, -1):\n        digit = int(num_str[i])\n        alternating_sum += sign * digit\n        sign *= -1\n\n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0\n```"}
