{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Any\n\ndef is_Monotonic(array: List[Any]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the input array is monotonic.\n    An empty array or an array with a single element is considered monotonic.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_non_increasing = True\n    for i in range(len(array) - 1):\n        if array[i] < array[i+1]:\n            is_non_increasing = False\n            break\n\n    is_non_decreasing = True\n    for i in range(len(array) - 1):\n        if array[i] > array[i+1]:\n            is_non_decreasing = False\n            break\n\n    return is_non_increasing or is_non_decreasing\n```"}
