{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "def divisor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the number of positive divisors for a given integer.\n    Iterates up to the square root of n to efficiently count divisors.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i * i == n:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n        i += 1\n    return count"}
