{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "```python\ndef sum_common_divisors(num1, num2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of common positive divisors for two given integers.\n    It iterates up to the smaller of the two numbers to find common divisors.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_val = min(num1, num2)\n    sum_of_divisors = 0\n\n    for i in range(1, min_val + 1):\n        if num1 % i == 0 and num2 % i == 0:\n            sum_of_divisors += i\n\n    return sum_of_divisors\n```"}
