{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "```python\ndef list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits an input_list into n sublists, distributing elements by interleaved indices.\n    Each sublist i contains elements from input_list at indices i, i+n, i+2n, etc.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for idx, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = idx % n\n        result[target_sublist_index].append(element)\n    return result\n```"}
