{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr: List[int], k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in an array formed by\n    repeating the given array `arr` `k` times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _calculate_max_subarray_sum(sub_arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        if not sub_arr:\n            return 0\n        max_so_far = sub_arr[0]\n        current_max = sub_arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, len(sub_arr)):\n            current_max = max(sub_arr[i], current_max + sub_arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n        return max_so_far\n\n    def _calculate_total_sum(sub_arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        return sum(sub_arr)\n\n    def _calculate_max_prefix_sum(sub_arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        if not sub_arr:\n            return 0\n        current_sum = 0\n        max_prefix = float('-inf')\n        for x in sub_arr:\n            current_sum += x\n            max_prefix = max(max_prefix, current_sum)\n        return max_prefix\n\n    def _calculate_max_suffix_sum(sub_arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        if not sub_arr:\n            return 0\n        current_sum = 0\n        max_suffix = float('-inf')\n        for x in reversed(sub_arr):\\\n            current_sum += x\n            max_suffix = max(max_suffix, current_sum)\n        return max_suffix\n\n    if not arr:\n        return 0\n\n    max_sum_single = _calculate_max_subarray_sum(arr)\n\n    if k == 1:\n        return max_sum_single\n\n    # For k > 1\n    max_sum_double = _calculate_max_subarray_sum(arr + arr)\n\n    overall_max_sum = max(max_sum_single, max_sum_double)\n\n    total_arr_sum = _calculate_total_sum(arr)\n\n    if total_arr_sum > 0:\n        max_pref = _calculate_max_prefix_sum(arr)\n        max_suff = _calculate_max_suffix_sum(arr)\n        max_sum_spanning = max_pref + (k - 2) * total_arr_sum + max_suff\n        overall_max_sum = max(overall_max_sum, max_sum_spanning)\n\n    return overall_max_sum\n```\n"}
