{"task_id": "Mbpp/581", "solution": "import math\n\ndef surface_Area(base_edge: float, height: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total surface area of a square pyramid.\n    It sums the base area and the lateral surface area.\"\"\"\n\n    # Calculate the slant height of the pyramid.\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(height**2 + (base_edge / 2)**2)\n\n    # Calculate the area of the square base.\n    base_area = base_edge * base_edge\n\n    # Calculate the lateral surface area (sum of the areas of the four triangular faces).\n    lateral_surface_area = 2 * base_edge * slant_height\n\n    # The total surface area is the sum of the base area and the lateral surface area.\n    total_surface_area = base_area + lateral_surface_area\n\n    return total_surface_area"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "```python\ndef _factorial(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer n.\n    Returns 1 for n=0 or n=1, and the product of integers from 1 to n otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Factorial is not defined for negative numbers.\")\n    if n == 0 or n == 1:\n        return 1\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\n\ndef _combinations(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient \"n choose k\".\n    Returns 0 if k is less than 0 or greater than n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k # Optimization: C(n, k) = C(n, n-k)\n\n    # C(n, k) = n! / (k! * (n-k)!)\n    # To avoid large intermediate numbers, compute as (n * (n-1) * ... * (n-k+1)) / k!\n    numerator = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        numerator *= (n - i)\n    denominator = _factorial(k)\n    return numerator // denominator\n\ndef catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Catalan number (C_n).\n    Raises a ValueError if the input n is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input n must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    # Catalan number C_n = 1 / (n + 1) * C(2n, n)\n    binomial_coefficient = _combinations(2 * n, n)\n    return binomial_coefficient // (n + 1)\n```\n"}
