{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "```python\ndef catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Catalan number.\n    This function computes the value using the binomial coefficient formula.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _binomial_coefficient(N, K):\n        \"\"\"Calculates N choose K, the binomial coefficient.\"\"\"\n        if K < 0 or K > N: return 0\n        if K == 0 or K == N: return 1\n        if K > N // 2: K = N - K\n\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(K):\n            res = res * (N - i) // (i + 1)\n        return res\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    # C_n = (1 / (n + 1)) * (2n choose n)\n    # This is equivalent to (2n choose n) / (n + 1)\n    binomial_coeff = _binomial_coefficient(2 * n, n)\n    return binomial_coeff // (n + 1)\n```"}
