{"task_id": "Mbpp/578", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import Any\n\nclass ListLengthMismatchError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"\n    Custom exception raised when input lists for interleaving have unequal lengths.\n    It indicates a violation of the equal length requirement for the input lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, message: str):\n        super().__init__(message)\n\ndef interleave_lists(list1: list[Any], list2: list[Any], list3: list[Any]) -> list[Any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Interleaves elements from three input lists into a single flat list.\n    Raises ListLengthMismatchError if input lists are not of equal length.\n    \"\"\"\n    len1, len2, len3 = len(list1), len(list2), len(list3)\n\n    if not (len1 == len2 == len3):\n        raise ListLengthMismatchError(\"Input lists must all be of the same length.\")\n\n    interleaved_result = []\n    for i in range(len1):\n        interleaved_result.append(list1[i])\n        interleaved_result.append(list2[i])\n        interleaved_result.append(list3[i])\n\n    return interleaved_result\n```\n"}
