{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "```python\ndef factorial(val):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\n    Assumes input is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if val == 0:\n        return 1\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, val + 1):\n        res *= i\n    return res\n\ndef binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k) using factorials.\n    Assumes n and k are non-negative integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    return factorial(n) // (factorial(k) * factorial(n - k))\n\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients C(n, k) * C(n, k+1).\n    The sum is performed for k from 0 to n-1.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n):\n        coeff1 = binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n        coeff2 = binomial_coefficient(n, k + 1)\n        total_sum += coeff1 * coeff2\n    return total_sum\n```"}
