{"task_id": "Mbpp/632", "solution": "```python\ndef move_zero(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Moves all occurrences of 0 to the end of the list, preserving relative order of non-zero elements.\n    Returns the modified list.\n    \"\"\"\n    non_zero_elements = []\n    zero_count = 0\n\n    for element in input_list:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_elements.append(element)\n\n    # Append the collected zeroes to the end of the non-zero elements\n    non_zero_elements.extend([0] * zero_count)\n\n    return non_zero_elements\n```"}
