{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "```python\ndef pair_xor_Sum(numbers: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the bitwise XOR of all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    It iterates through all unique pairs and accumulates their XOR sums.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            num1 = numbers[i]\n            num2 = numbers[j]\n            pair_xor = num1 ^ num2\n            total_xor_sum += pair_xor\n\n    return total_xor_sum\n```"}
