{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "```python\ndef find_min_diff(arr: tuple, n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in the input array.\n    First sorts the array, then iterates through adjacent elements to find the minimum difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_arr = sorted(arr)\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        diff = abs(sorted_arr[i + 1] - sorted_arr[i])\n        if diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = diff\n\n    return min_diff\n```"}
